# 📄 PaperLens - AI-Powered Research Paper Assistant

## Day 56 Task Completion

PaperLens is an AI-powered research paper assistant that helps users upload research papers and generate easy-to-understand summaries.

## Features Completed

* ✅ Upload research paper PDF files
* ✅ Extract text from uploaded PDFs
* ✅ Process research paper content
* ✅ Generate structured summaries
* ✅ Display summary results in frontend
* ✅ Integrated React frontend with FastAPI backend

##  Tech Stack

### Frontend

* React.js
* Vite
* JavaScript
* CSS

### Backend

* FastAPI
* Python
* Uvicorn

### AI Integration

* Google Gemini API

### Database & Storage

* SQLite
* Local file storage

