## ⚙️ How to Run

### Backend

```bash
cd backend
uvicorn app.main:app --reload
```

Backend runs at:

```
http://127.0.0.1:8000
```

### Frontend

```bash
cd frontend
npm run dev
```

Frontend runs at:

```
http://localhost:5173
```

